)}</div></details><details class="mobile-character home-character"><summary>いれーなのステータス・装備を確認</summary>${characterSummary(a,p)}</details><div class="row save-actions home-save-actions">${button('セーブ書き出し','export','','ghost small')}${button('セーブ読み込み','import','','ghost small')}${button('仕様・操作ガイド','about','','ghost small')}${button(sound?'音 ON':'音 OFF','sound','','ghost small')}</div>`;
